  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: f4688fdb7df04437aeb418b961361dc5, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  m_Material: {fileID: 0}
  m_Color: {r: 1, g: 1, b: 1, a: 1}
  m_RaycastTarget: 1
  m_RaycastPadding: {x: 0, y: 0, z: 0, w: 0}
  m_Maskable: 1
  m_OnCullStateChanged:
    m_PersistentCalls:
      m_Calls: []
  m_text: 'A plant cell is the basic structural and functional unit of a plant. Although
    it is very small, it contains several specialized parts that perform important
    functions to keep the cell healthy and active.

    The cell wall is the strong
    outermost layer of the plant cell. It protects the cell, provides support, and
    helps maintain its shape. Just inside the cell wall is the cell membrane, a thin
    and flexible layer that controls which substances enter and leave the cell.

    The
    inside of the cell is filled with cytoplasm, a jelly-like substance that surrounds
    the organelles and provides a space where many important chemical reactions take
    place. The nucleus acts as the control center of the cell. It contains genetic
    material called DNA and controls important cell activities such as growth and
    development.

    Chloroplasts are especially important in plant cells because
    they contain chlorophyll, the green pigment that captures energy from sunlight.
    This energy is used during photosynthesis to help the plant make food.

    The
    mitochondria, often called the powerhouse of the cell, release usable energy
    from food. This energy allows the cell to carry out its essential activities.

    Another
    important structure is the large central vacuole. It stores water, nutrients,
    and waste materials. The water stored in the vacuole also helps maintain pressure
    inside the cell, keeping it firm.

    Together, these specialized structures
    allow the plant cell to perform the processes necessary for the plant to grow,
    function, and survive.'
  m_isRightToLeft: 0
  m_fontAsset: {fileID: 11400000, guid: ecf77945acdc26144b2f70e021c9fd31, type: 2}
